# What the build downloads and what it caches. The output is not ignored here because it is
# not written here: it lands in ../docs/guide, and the root .gitignore is what keeps it out of
# the tree — a generated tree is published by the workflow that builds it, never committed.
node_modules
.astro
*.local

# What the build derives from the tool itself (RK1402, RK1403). Ignored by what generated it
# and never by directory: `src/data/` also holds situations.json, which is the hand-written
# half of a finding page and the one thing on it no read can derive.
src/data/*.generated.json
src/content/docs/findings/
